      PMP22 haploinsufficiency); the canonical 'gene dosage' disease (3 copies -> CMT1A; 1 -> HNPP;
      2 -> normal). Suspended PURELY on engine-readability, NOT for lack of therapy (no approved
      disease-modifying drug -- supportive care + orthoses + surgery is a PHYSICAL track; PMP22-lowering
